Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.81,0:00:05.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's our next class again?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.27,0:00:06.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Math?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When are we ever gonna use that stuff, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.61,0:00:13.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't touch the do!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.83,0:00:18.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Every time our eyes met,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.91,0:00:23.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,we averted our gazes at first...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...and then looked back at each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That was me and Kou in our first year of middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No one knows...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...about our awkward days together.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.32,0:02:20.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to see Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The advanced track's shoe lockers...{because well, shoeboxes are shoeboxes}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who're you looking for?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.18,0:02:42.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.18,0:02:47.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, you make up with your friends or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.14,0:02:50.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, that plan went down the drain.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.23,0:02:55.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But you know, sometimes things just don't go your way.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's when you go back to step one.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.99,0:03:07.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.91,0:03:12.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wasn't done talking to you yet...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the girl from before!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What more do you have to say?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get off my case.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, this is something else.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.26,0:03:28.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm coming over to make dinner today, so make sure you're home.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be staying the night, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Staying?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, all night?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Th-They're in {\i0}that{\i1} kind of relationship?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.57,0:03:43.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stupid, what are you imagining?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're brothers.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.00,0:03:53.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not a secret or anything, but we don't go out of our way to tell people either.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Most people have no idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Brothers?! No wonder they look alike!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, are you two dating?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.14,0:04:08.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Excuse{\i0} me? You really think I'd date a pig who eats more than me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.60,0:04:12.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said you liked me back in middle school!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You said you liked me back! {I know we used love before but this seems to fit the situation better}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, that time? You thought I was serious?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just went with the flow.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?! We gazed at each other all the time back then too!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Only 'cause you kept staring at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,In any case, none of that matters now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't run!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,One way or another, you two seem to get along well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.92,0:04:42.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.34,0:04:44.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.30,0:04:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's a nice name.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba, huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.39,0:04:58.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh! {\i1}You're{\i0} Futaba-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.44,0:05:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's a teacher hitting on a student over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's joking!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, I wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So she's Yoshioka Futaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:28.68,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.965\blur0.5\pos(816.667,277.333)}Yoshioka Futaba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:28.80,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.965\blur0.5\pos(816.667,277.333)\clip(m 795 264 l 773 251 913 200 1002 231 966 304 807 274)}Yoshioka Futaba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:29.68,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.965\blur0.5\pos(816.667,277.333)}Yoshioka Futaba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:29.80,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.965\blur0.5\clip(m 795 264 l 773 251 913 200 1002 231 966 304 807 274)\pos(816.667,277.333)}Yoshioka Futaba
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:30.14,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\frz4.965\blur0.5\pos(816.667,277.333)}Yoshioka Futaba
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.35,0:05:36.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.28,0:05:44.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, is she your crush?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.28,0:05:45.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.45,0:05:57.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you and Tanaka-sensei don't live together.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.00,0:06:02.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He teaches at the school I go to, so you'd think so.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you have your own place then?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.13,0:06:07.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, but my brother does.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So are you back at your old house now?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,With your mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.64,0:06:15.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's just me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why don't you change your name back...{the back is important}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.15,0:06:21.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Haven't you had enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just shut up. It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.57,0:06:30.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can't say that when you're literally dragging me in.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.08,0:06:41.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I let go, so stop asking.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We're looking straight at each other...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...but it feels like he's staring right through me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.85,0:07:01.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just ask me to let you go?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.44,0:07:06.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get off of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.44,0:07:11.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Where did your feelings go, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.16,0:07:18.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Y-You disappear without a trace \Nand now you come back out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.66,0:07:23.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are so many questions I want to ask!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.09,0:07:28.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are so many thoughts running through my head I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told you it was annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.98,0:07:46.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.44,0:07:47.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,On the day of that summer festival...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.11,0:07:54.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Were you waiting for me at Triangle Park?{the ... only makes sense if the part you're delaying is the waiting}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was waiting...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.09,0:08:09.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've always been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.34,0:08:18.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I always thought... that you hated guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.68,0:08:25.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, even so... I was still going to meet you at Triangle Park.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.15,0:08:30.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But as soon as summer break started, my family fell apart.{I prefer "vacation"}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Lots of stuff happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.20,0:08:42.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't meet up with you that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.67,0:08:54.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's right. Kou has a lot of stuff going on in his life.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,A lot more than I have to worry about.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And still, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've been really insensitive.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.10,0:09:06.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.94,0:09:14.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.55,0:09:34.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, my house is this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.17,0:09:35.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright.{I guess this is going to be an "alright" show. It's been a while since we've done one of those.}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.43,0:09:39.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you excited for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.43,0:09:44.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "why"?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei's going over to cook for you, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, I almost forgot he was coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have fun! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.37,0:10:04.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That was great! Kou told me more about himself.
