Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your big brother's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.49,0:10:45.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And I always will be.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.10,0:11:08.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.98,0:11:13.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Even if you lose something, all you have to do is make it again.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll be more careful from now on.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Starting today...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...I'll remake it all from step one.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.70,0:11:28.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka, Yoshioka...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There I am. Class 2 it is.
