Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It all starts today.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.59,0:11:40.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll start it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! Murao!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.81,0:11:54.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're in the same class again! \NLookin' forward to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure. {domowned}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.52,0:12:00.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't have any attachment to our class last year,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.36,0:12:05.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but I won't let you say that again after this year!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Looks like I got stuck in the class with all the hotheads.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.79,0:12:16.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, after school today...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.67,0:12:22.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.76,0:12:27.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou and I... are in the same class?!{nice slip}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, it's way too early.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm starting over.{I know it's transitive and all that but I think it's enough to say "I'm starting" (hajimeru) instead of "it's starting" (for hajimaru)}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm through with making shallow friends
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.87,0:12:50.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and deceiving myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.83,0:12:55.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm in a new class, I'm going to rebuild everything from step one.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.12,0:12:59.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it feel to drop down to our class from the advanced track?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bet you're pissed that you have to be in the same class as guys like us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Man, could that question be any more laced with poison?{maybe even without the "the poison"}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.81,0:13:16.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why would it bother me? I'm not even all that smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.02,0:13:22.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Back in middle school, I got really into studying for some reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.99,0:13:25.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But when I tried to take a little break in high school,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.45,0:13:29.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,my grades fell right through the floor.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi, are you really Tanaka's brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.41,0:13:37.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You do look pretty similar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.79,0:13:43.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's really good at keeping the conversation flowing and letting the mood stay chill.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.47,0:13:54.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.56,0:13:57.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.52,0:14:00.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What are you, an elementary schooler?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.19,0:14:05.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you're an elementary schooler.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.87,0:14:12.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.49,0:14:15.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, see that girl right there?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I heard the girls in her class all gave her the cold shoulder last year.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, why?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.13,0:14:24.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Dunno, but there must've been a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.43,0:14:32.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She's pretending that it doesn't bother her.
