Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,People are so easily swayed. {or she might be saying "easily ignored"}{I'm pretty sure this is the correct meaning}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Myself included.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.27,0:14:45.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is make it seem like Makita-san has friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Makita-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's the one you gave me before.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You ended up using it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
