Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.12,0:15:01.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're having a normal conversation.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess it wasn't her personality.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.63,0:15:07.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yes, going good! Just a bit more...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's her!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.43,0:15:13.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I heard she got in a huge fight with some girls in her class last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:14.93,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\p1\blur1\c&HF2F0EE&\pos(630.096,92.762)\fscx113\fscy36}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:14.93,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H868482&\fs50\blur0.6\pos(634.667,100.667)}Her
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.05,0:15:14.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So we should look out for her?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.93,0:15:16.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She looks really rough, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.64,0:15:17.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is she a delinquent? {generic trans on yankee}{sure}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm rough on purpose, but I'm no delinquent.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, now they're going to isolate me instead!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.53,0:15:35.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san, g-good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.16,0:15:42.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She might be easier to talk to than I expected.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.33,0:15:42.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-s—
