Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She shut me out completely!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.76,0:15:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning! What'cha reading? \NGot any good music playing?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.73,0:16:05.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, Lady Luck must love us if she put us in the same class again.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.73,0:16:09.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Please stop! Your fruitless advances remind me too much of myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.53,0:16:14.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and speaking of lucky, when I was at the convenience store the other day...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.63,0:16:27.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's hard to make any moves.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So how's the new class?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.05,0:16:31.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kind of all over the place.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.60,0:16:39.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try running for class rep?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.81,0:16:40.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.47,0:16:44.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly that type of person...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.77,0:16:48.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,High school will be over before you know it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.77,0:16:52.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get out there and try some things that you can only do now.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.29,0:17:02.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.37,0:17:03.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How gloomy.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Depressed already?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.96,0:17:14.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't take my first step if I have nowhere to stand.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm already falling down the path to isolation.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.39,0:17:24.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, I always knew how indecisive you were.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.77,0:17:28.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That doesn't exactly cheer me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And I never intended to.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.82,0:17:38.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You talked big about starting over from the first step, and you're like this in less than a day?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.45,0:17:42.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Life wasted no time in showing me how powerless I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What does that matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.62,0:17:49.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No one would mind if you fell apart this quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But on the flip side,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.84,0:17:59.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,no one would mind if you kept at it either.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.89,0:18:04.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like anything's started for you yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.14,0:18:07.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just do what you want to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.10,0:18:12.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Nothing has started yet,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,nor have I started anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.61,0:18:18.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If I really want to start something new,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,then it shouldn't surprise me
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,that it'll take more than I've ever had to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDAEBDC&\fsp1\fry-2\blur0.7\fax-.3\frz16.05\move(686.096,74.761,745.296,74.761,20,3691)}Class Representative
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDAEBDC&\fsp1\fry-2\blur0.7\fax-.3\frz16.05\move(151.333,202.666,202.533,202.666,20,3691)}Event Planner
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to volunteer?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.79,0:18:37.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you don't decide soon, we'll be here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:38.26,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\blur0.5\move(838.4,288.267,1026.4,288.267,25,5447)}Class Representative
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:38.26,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\blur0.5\move(724.4,287.4,915.067,287.4,25,5447)}Event Planner
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.05,0:18:38.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one with any right to complain.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If I don't change,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.69,0:18:50.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,then I can't take that first step.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.27,0:18:54.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You'll do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.23,0:18:56.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.36,0:19:00.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then Yoshioka will be our female representative.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka, take over from here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...start it! {how to say this... I'm tired and we had this before, and I don't like 'something', and she's referring to everything, and blah blah blah}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:18.42,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDBE7DA&\blur0.6\pos(678.667,141)}Yoshioka \NFutaba
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right, moving on...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.42,0:19:22.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think we should decide on our male representative.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.39,0:19:24.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to make this class more fun with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.56,0:19:34.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Please raise your hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Guess it's up to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If there are no objections, Mabuchi-kun gets the position.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I was a second too late...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun, please come up and assist me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.93,0:20:03.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.77,0:20:10.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stupid. I just wanted to finish this up quick and go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's get this done already.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We need three event planners.{Barack Obama is a president. He is President Barack Obama. Sepp Blatter is a president. He is FIFA president Sepp Blatter.}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.69,0:20:22.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Anyone wanna do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be one.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You'll really do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you'll be a huge help!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.79,0:20:37.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, two to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be an event planner.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.39,0:20:54.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If Murao-san's in, then the last spot has to go to...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.60,0:20:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.23,0:20:59.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be the last event planner!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.23,0:21:00.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.12,0:21:16.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That finished pretty quickly. But seriously, what a strange bunch we are.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.00,0:21:22.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good. You class reps and event planners will need to attend a leadership course.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.55,0:21:24.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Leadership course?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.38,0:21:28.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's an overnight course. Tanaka-sensei will be leading it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.60,0:21:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's with that look? Got something to say?{retimed}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,N-Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm starting it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is something I can only do now.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.28,0:21:52.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Only at this moment, only with these people!{}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord3\blur3\3c&HE3B43C&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\c&HFFFEF9&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.17,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,When we look back on this,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.26,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,I want everyone who shared this experience
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.22,0:23:37.27,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,to remember these warm and fun times.
